bile)","Modern UI/UX Design","Responsive on All Devices","Admin Panel Integration","Fast & Secure Performance","3 Revisions Included","Deployment Support"],"buttonText":"Get Started","isPopular":true,"createdAt":"2026-01-15T12:23:15.824Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-15T12:23:15.824Z","__v":0}},{"id":"6968dd6b09927b1d101b5a6e","title":"Advanced Software Solution","price":"200","billingCycle":"one-time","billingNote":"Best for large & complex business applications","badge":"ENTERPRISE","buttonText":"Get Started","platformLimit":"3 Platforms (Web + Mobile + Admin)","features":["25+ Screens / Pages","Full Custom Software Development","Website + Mobile App Development","Advanced API & Data Integration","3 Platforms Support (Web + Mobile + Admin Panel)","Custom Dashboard & Admin Panel","High Performance & Secure System","Advanced UI/UX Design","Authentication & User Roles","5 Revisions Included","Priority Support"],"highlighted":false,"raw":{"_id":"6968dd6b09927b1d101b5a6e","planBadge":"ENTERPRISE","planName":"Advanced Software Solution","price":200,"billingCycle":"one-time","billingNote":"Best for large & complex business applications","platformLimit":"3 Platforms (Web + Mobile + Admin)","features":["25+ Screens / Pages","Full Custom Software Development","Website + Mobile App Development","Advanced API & Data Integration","3 Platforms Support (Web + Mobile + Admin Panel)","Custom Dashboard & Admin Panel","High Performance & Secure System","Advanced UI/UX Design","Authentication & User Roles","5 Revisions Included","Priority Support"],"buttonText":"Get Started","isPopular":false,"createdAt":"2026-01-15T12:28:27.545Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-15T12:28:27.545Z","__v":0}}],"projects":[{"id":"69664bd56838d643770481f2","slug":"ocr-master-image-to-text-69664bd56838d643770481f2","title":"OCR Master Image to Text","description":"The Image to Text app is a mobile utility designed to convert text from images into editable digital text using OCR (Optical Character Recognition) technology. It allows users to take photos of printed or handwritten text, screenshots, receipts, or documents—or select images from the gallery—and automatically extract the text for editing, copying, or sharing. The primary goal of the project is to save time and effort by eliminating manual typing and to provide a fast, reliable, and user-friendly solution for digitizing text. The app targets a wide audience including students, professionals, and everyday users who need to quickly convert image content into usable text for documentation, communication, or productivity purposes.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768311764/njbskloubbkvurty9jnx.webp","category":"Mobile App","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"69664bd56838d643770481f2","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768311764/njbskloubbkvurty9jnx.webp","PName":"OCR Master Image to Text","PDescription":"The Image to Text app is a mobile utility designed to convert text from images into editable digital text using OCR (Optical Character Recognition) technology. It allows users to take photos of printed or handwritten text, screenshots, receipts, or documents—or select images from the gallery—and automatically extract the text for editing, copying, or sharing.\r\n\r\nThe primary goal of the project is to save time and effort by eliminating manual typing and to provide a fast, reliable, and user-friendly solution for digitizing text. The app targets a wide audience including students, professionals, and everyday users who need to quickly convert image content into usable text for documentation, communication, or productivity purposes.","PType":"Mobile App","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:1985/","clientName":"Bulk Bytes","projectCategory":"Tool","startDate":"2022-08-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2022-09-01T00:00:00.000Z","address":"Bulk Bytes","strategyTitle":"Flutter Development","strategyDescription":"This project is built using Flutter and Firebase a modern and efficient technology stack that ensures high performance, real-time data handling, and reliable local data storage.","challengeTitle":"OCR Text Accuracy","challengeDescription":"Ensuring fast and accurate text extraction from images.","clientReview":null,"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T13:42:45.201Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-13T13:42:45.201Z","__v":0}},{"id":"69664adc6838d643770480a3","slug":"smart-dictionary-69664adc6838d643770480a3","title":"Smart Dictionary","description":"The Smart Dictionary app is a mobile educational application designed to help users learn, understand, and use English words effectively. It provides detailed definitions, synonyms, example sentences, parts of speech, and audio pronunciations to support vocabulary building, language comprehension, and proper word usage. The app targets students, writers, professionals, and language learners who need a reliable reference tool for quick word lookup. With a fast search feature, intuitive interface, and no extra downloads required, users can efficiently find the meanings of words and learn correct pronunciation and usage. The app also supports synonyms and example sentences, enabling better understanding and application of words in real-life scenarios.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768311516/ndp6saswbtyiolza46mz.webp","category":"Mobile App","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"69664adc6838d643770480a3","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768311516/ndp6saswbtyiolza46mz.webp","PName":"Smart Dictionary","PDescription":"The Smart Dictionary app is a mobile educational application designed to help users learn, understand, and use English words effectively. It provides detailed definitions, synonyms, example sentences, parts of speech, and audio pronunciations to support vocabulary building, language comprehension, and proper word usage.\r\n\r\nThe app targets students, writers, professionals, and language learners who need a reliable reference tool for quick word lookup. With a fast search feature, intuitive interface, and no extra downloads required, users can efficiently find the meanings of words and learn correct pronunciation and usage. The app also supports synonyms and example sentences, enabling better understanding and application of words in real-life scenarios.","PType":"Mobile App","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:1985/","clientName":"Bulk Bytes","projectCategory":"Education","startDate":"2022-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2022-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","address":"Bulk Bytes","strategyTitle":"Flutter Development","strategyDescription":"This project is built using Flutter and Firebase a modern and efficient technology stack that ensures high performance, real-time data handling, and reliable local data storage.","challengeTitle":"Accurate Word Lookup","challengeDescription":"Ensuring fast and accurate word search with definitions and pronunciation.","clientReview":null,"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T13:38:36.545Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-13T13:38:36.545Z","__v":0}},{"id":"696649976838d64377047f08","slug":"voice-to-text-voice-typing-app-696649976838d64377047f08","title":"Voice to text Voice typing app","description":"The Voice to Text – Voice Typing App is a mobile application designed to convert spoken words into written text in real time, making it easier for users to create notes, messages, or documents without manual typing. Using advanced speech recognition technology, the app accurately transcribes speech into text with support for multiple languages and automatic spacing for readability. The app is aimed at a wide range of users, including students, professionals, content creators, and people with typing difficulties, offering a faster, hands-free, and more convenient way to generate text on mobile devices. Transcribed text can be shared across social media platforms, messaging apps, and other tools, allowing for efficient communication and documentation.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768311190/frgs2xgf6uogkwaoq1od.webp","category":"Mobile App","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"696649976838d64377047f08","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768311190/frgs2xgf6uogkwaoq1od.webp","PName":"Voice to text Voice typing app","PDescription":"The Voice to Text – Voice Typing App is a mobile application designed to convert spoken words into written text in real time, making it easier for users to create notes, messages, or documents without manual typing. Using advanced speech recognition technology, the app accurately transcribes speech into text with support for multiple languages and automatic spacing for readability.\r\n\r\nThe app is aimed at a wide range of users, including students, professionals, content creators, and people with typing difficulties, offering a faster, hands-free, and more convenient way to generate text on mobile devices. Transcribed text can be shared across social media platforms, messaging apps, and other tools, allowing for efficient communication and documentation.","PType":"Mobile App","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:1985/","clientName":"Bulk Bytes","projectCategory":"Tool","startDate":"2022-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2022-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","address":"Bulk Bytes","strategyTitle":"Flutter Development","strategyDescription":"This project is built using Flutter and Firebase a modern and efficient technology stack that ensures high performance, real-time data handling, and reliable local data storage.","challengeTitle":"Real-Time Speech Accuracy","challengeDescription":"Ensuring fast and accurate voice-to-text transcription across multiple languages.","clientReview":null,"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T13:33:11.061Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-13T13:33:11.061Z","__v":0}},{"id":"6966478e6838d64377047c89","slug":"kids-learning-6966478e6838d64377047c89","title":"kids learning","description":"The Kids Learning App is a mobile educational application designed to provide interactive learning experiences for toddlers and preschoolers. The app focuses on early childhood education by teaching foundational concepts such as alphabets, numbers, colors, shapes, animals, birds, fruits, and vegetables through vibrant visuals, interactive activities, and engaging content. The main goal of the project is to make learning fun, simple, and accessible for young children, while also offering a safe and intuitive interface that prevents accidental exits or confusion. By combining colorful graphics, easy navigation, and educational modules, the app encourages curiosity, cognitive development, and early vocabulary building.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768310668/xpmmouij3dkev90yvjjz.webp","category":"Mobile App","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"6966478e6838d64377047c89","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768310668/xpmmouij3dkev90yvjjz.webp","PName":"kids learning","PDescription":"The Kids Learning App is a mobile educational application designed to provide interactive learning experiences for toddlers and preschoolers. The app focuses on early childhood education by teaching foundational concepts such as alphabets, numbers, colors, shapes, animals, birds, fruits, and vegetables through vibrant visuals, interactive activities, and engaging content.\r\n\r\nThe main goal of the project is to make learning fun, simple, and accessible for young children, while also offering a safe and intuitive interface that prevents accidental exits or confusion. By combining colorful graphics, easy navigation, and educational modules, the app encourages curiosity, cognitive development, and early vocabulary building.","PType":"Mobile App","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:1985/","clientName":"Bulk Bytes","startDate":"2022-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2022-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","address":"Bulk Bytes","strategyTitle":"Flutter Development","strategyDescription":"This project is built using Flutter and Firebase a modern and efficient technology stack that ensures high performance, real-time data handling, and reliable local data storage.","challengeTitle":"Kid-Friendly Interactive Design","challengeDescription":"Ensuring engaging, age-appropriate content with a simple and safe interface for young children.","clientReview":null,"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T13:24:30.350Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-13T13:24:30.350Z","__v":0}},{"id":"696645bc6838d64377047a54","slug":"resize-compress-image-mb-to-kb-696645bc6838d64377047a54","title":"Resize Compress Image MB to KB","description":"The Image Compressor app is a mobile utility designed to help users reduce the file size of their images quickly and efficiently while maintaining acceptable visual quality. Large photos can take up significant storage space, slow down uploads, or exceed file limits when sharing via email or messaging apps. This app solves these issues by compressing images from megabyte (MB) sizes to kilobyte (KB) sizes, making them easier to store, share, and upload. The app is aimed at casual users, students, professionals, and social media users who need a simple, fast, and reliable solution for managing large image files. Its straightforward interface allows users to select images, set compression preferences, and save optimized photos automatically to their device.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768460916/ayxjchcahmdbzpu6gq8a.png","category":"Mobile App","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"696645bc6838d64377047a54","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768460916/ayxjchcahmdbzpu6gq8a.png","PName":"Resize Compress Image MB to KB","PDescription":"The Image Compressor app is a mobile utility designed to help users reduce the file size of their images quickly and efficiently while maintaining acceptable visual quality. Large photos can take up significant storage space, slow down uploads, or exceed file limits when sharing via email or messaging apps. This app solves these issues by compressing images from megabyte (MB) sizes to kilobyte (KB) sizes, making them easier to store, share, and upload.\r\n\r\nThe app is aimed at casual users, students, professionals, and social media users who need a simple, fast, and reliable solution for managing large image files. Its straightforward interface allows users to select images, set compression preferences, and save optimized photos automatically to their device.","PType":"Mobile App","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:1985/","clientName":"Bulk Bytes","projectCategory":"Image Compresser","startDate":"2022-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2022-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","address":"Bulk Bytes","strategyTitle":"Flutter Development","strategyDescription":"This project is built using Flutter and Firebase a modern and efficient technology stack that ensures high performance, real-time data handling, and reliable local data storage.","challengeTitle":"Real-Time Image Compression & Quality Maintenance","challengeDescription":"Faced challenges in compressing images quickly without losing quality and ensuring accurate file size reduction, which were resolved to deliver fast, reliable, and high-quality image optimisation for users.","clientReview":null,"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T13:16:44.668Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-15T06:40:53.296Z","__v":0}},{"id":"69663a596838d64377046b64","slug":"quick-invoice-maker-69663a596838d64377046b64","title":"Quick Invoice Maker","description":"The Quick Invoice Maker & Estimate Generator is a mobile application designed to simplify the process of creating professional invoices, estimates, and receipts directly from a smartphone. The app targets freelancers, small business owners, and self-employed professionals who need to generate billing documents quickly and accurately, without relying on complex accounting software or desktop systems. It allows users to create, customize, and share invoices and estimates on the go, ensuring faster payments, better record keeping, and efficient management of business finances. The app is optimized for ease-of-use and real-time editing, making it suitable for both individual professionals and small teams.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768307288/zbb1a6taccwiohydztf2.webp","category":"Mobile App","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"69663a596838d64377046b64","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768307288/zbb1a6taccwiohydztf2.webp","PName":"Quick Invoice Maker","PDescription":"The Quick Invoice Maker & Estimate Generator is a mobile application designed to simplify the process of creating professional invoices, estimates, and receipts directly from a smartphone. The app targets freelancers, small business owners, and self-employed professionals who need to generate billing documents quickly and accurately, without relying on complex accounting software or desktop systems.\r\n\r\nIt allows users to create, customize, and share invoices and estimates on the go, ensuring faster payments, better record keeping, and efficient management of business finances. The app is optimized for ease-of-use and real-time editing, making it suitable for both individual professionals and small teams.","PType":"Mobile App","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:1985/","clientName":"Bulk Bytes","projectCategory":"Invoice Maker","startDate":"2022-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2022-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","address":"Bulk Bytes","strategyTitle":"Flutter Development","strategyDescription":"This project is built using Flutter—a modern and efficient technology stack that ensures high performance, real-time data handling, and scalable cloud-based functionality.","challengeTitle":"Real-Time Invoice Accuracy","challengeDescription":"Faced challenges in generating invoices in real-time, ensuring accurate calculations, and syncing data reliably, which were optimized to enhance app performance and user experience.","clientReview":null,"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T12:28:09.201Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-13T12:28:09.201Z","__v":0}},{"id":"696631a86838d6437704611d","slug":"u-track-lite-app-696631a86838d6437704611d","title":"U Track Lite App","description":"U-Track is an advanced GPS tracking and fleet management system designed to provide real-time visibility, security, and control over vehicles and mobile assets. The platform empowers individual users and businesses with precise location tracking, live movement data, and actionable alerts to improve safety, efficiency, and operational management across Pakistan. The system combines GPRS/GSM connectivity with modern satellite and mobile technologies to deliver continuous monitoring and reporting of vehicle activities, including real-time location, route history, speed, ignition status, and geo-fencing alerts. Users can access this information via a web dashboard or mobile app, enabling remote management anytime and from anywhere.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768305064/euilbeza0q0nzag23nhm.png","category":"Mobile App","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"696631a86838d6437704611d","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768305064/euilbeza0q0nzag23nhm.png","PName":"U Track Lite App","PDescription":"U-Track is an advanced GPS tracking and fleet management system designed to provide real-time visibility, security, and control over vehicles and mobile assets. The platform empowers individual users and businesses with precise location tracking, live movement data, and actionable alerts to improve safety, efficiency, and operational management across Pakistan.\r\n\r\nThe system combines GPRS/GSM connectivity with modern satellite and mobile technologies to deliver continuous monitoring and reporting of vehicle activities, including real-time location, route history, speed, ignition status, and geo-fencing alerts. Users can access this information via a web dashboard or mobile app, enabling remote management anytime and from anywhere.","PType":"Mobile App","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:1985/","clientName":"Mr Jamshad","projectCategory":"Vehicle Tracking System","address":"UTrack Tracking Company","strategyTitle":"Flutter","strategyDescription":"This project is built using Flutter, FastAPI, Firebase, and SQLite (local database)—a modern and efficient technology stack that ensures high performance, real-time data handling, and reliable local data storage.","challengeTitle":"Vehicle Animation & Network Optimization","challengeDescription":"Vehicle animation was optimized, request times were reduced, and the app was made compatible with 2G and 3G internet networks.","clientReview":{"clientImage":null,"reviewDescription":"","clientName":"Mr Jamshad","designation":"CEO","reviewStars":4.5},"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T11:51:04.682Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-13T11:51:04.682Z","__v":0}},{"id":"69662e3c6838d64377045d2b","slug":"u-track-pro-app-69662e3c6838d64377045d2b","title":"U Track Pro App","description":"U-Track is an advanced GPS tracking and fleet management system designed to provide real-time visibility, security, and control over vehicles and mobile assets. The platform empowers individual users and businesses with precise location tracking, live movement data, and actionable alerts to improve safety, efficiency, and operational management across Pakistan. The system combines GPRS/GSM connectivity with modern satellite and mobile technologies to deliver continuous monitoring and reporting of vehicle activities, including real-time location, route history, speed, ignition status, and geo-fencing alerts. Users can access this information via a web dashboard or mobile app, enabling remote management anytime and from anywhere.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768304187/pzmx9ddhhlaqd82zyxff.png","category":"Mobile App","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"69662e3c6838d64377045d2b","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768304187/pzmx9ddhhlaqd82zyxff.png","PName":"U Track Pro App","PDescription":"U-Track is an advanced GPS tracking and fleet management system designed to provide real-time visibility, security, and control over vehicles and mobile assets. The platform empowers individual users and businesses with precise location tracking, live movement data, and actionable alerts to improve safety, efficiency, and operational management across Pakistan.\r\n\r\nThe system combines GPRS/GSM connectivity with modern satellite and mobile technologies to deliver continuous monitoring and reporting of vehicle activities, including real-time location, route history, speed, ignition status, and geo-fencing alerts. Users can access this information via a web dashboard or mobile app, enabling remote management anytime and from anywhere.","PType":"Mobile App","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:1985/","clientName":"Mr Jamshad","projectCategory":"Vehicle Tracking System","startDate":"2022-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2022-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","address":"Utrack Tracking Company","strategyTitle":"Flutter Development","strategyDescription":"This project is built using Flutter, FastAPI, and Firebase—a modern and efficient technology stack that ensures high performance, real-time data handling, and scalable cloud-based functionality.","challengeTitle":"Performance & Time Optimization","challengeDescription":"During the project, performance and timing-related issues were encountered, which were optimized to improve system speed and overall efficiency.","clientReview":{"clientImage":null,"reviewDescription":"","clientName":"Mr Jamshad","designation":"CEO","reviewStars":4.5},"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T11:36:28.271Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-13T11:36:28.271Z","__v":0}},{"id":"696621d16838d64377044b28","slug":"utrack-web-pro-696621d16838d64377044b28","title":"UTrack Web Pro","description":"U-Track is an advanced GPS tracking and fleet management system designed to provide real-time visibility, security, and control over vehicles and mobile assets. The platform empowers individual users and businesses with precise location tracking, live movement data, and actionable alerts to improve safety, efficiency, and operational management. The system combines GPRS/GSM connectivity with modern satellite and mobile technologies to deliver continuous monitoring and reporting of vehicle activities, including real-time location, route history, speed, ignition status, and geo-fencing alerts. Users can access this information via a web dashboard or mobile app , enabling remote management anytime and from anywhere.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768301008/n4c5yovrv88144qawqx0.png","category":"Web Development","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"696621d16838d64377044b28","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1768301008/n4c5yovrv88144qawqx0.png","PName":"UTrack Web Pro","PDescription":"U-Track is an advanced GPS tracking and fleet management system designed to provide real-time visibility, security, and control over vehicles and mobile assets. The platform empowers individual users and businesses with precise location tracking, live movement data, and actionable alerts to improve safety, efficiency, and operational management.\r\n\r\nThe system combines GPRS/GSM connectivity with modern satellite and mobile technologies to deliver continuous monitoring and reporting of vehicle activities, including real-time location, route history, speed, ignition status, and geo-fencing alerts. Users can access this information via a web dashboard or mobile app , enabling remote management anytime and from anywhere.","PType":"Web Development","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:1985/","clientName":"Mr Jamshad","projectCategory":"Vehicle Tracking System","startDate":"2025-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2025-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","address":"Utrack Tracking Company","strategyTitle":"MERN Stack","strategyDescription":"This project is built using the MERN Stack, a modern and powerful web development stack consisting of mongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js.","challengeTitle":"Map Integration Issues","challengeDescription":"During the project, technical issues were encountered while accurately displaying real-time GPS data on maps, such as location delays and marker synchronization problems, which were optimized to improve the overall tracking experience.","clientReview":{"clientImage":null,"reviewDescription":"","clientName":"Mr Jamshad","designation":"CEO","reviewStars":4.5},"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T10:43:29.328Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-13T10:43:29.328Z","__v":0}},{"id":"6960f0dd6838d64377040176","slug":"utrack-inventory-management-6960f0dd6838d64377040176","title":"Utrack Inventory Management","description":"UTrack Inventory Management System is a modern, powerful, and fully customizable business solution designed to manage the complete business workflow — from product purchasing to final sales. The system is built with a role-based access control architecture, ensuring that each user only has access to the features and data relevant to their role. It supports a multi-user environment where multiple users can work simultaneously with secure and controlled permissions.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1767960797/z5jtug3ydynqmeavkn4h.png","category":"Web Development","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"6960f0dd6838d64377040176","PImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1767960797/z5jtug3ydynqmeavkn4h.png","PName":"Utrack Inventory Management","PDescription":"UTrack Inventory Management System is a modern, powerful, and fully customizable business solution designed to manage the complete business workflow — from product purchasing to final sales.\r\nThe system is built with a role-based access control architecture, ensuring that each user only has access to the features and data relevant to their role. It supports a multi-user environment where multiple users can work simultaneously with secure and controlled permissions.","PType":"Web Development","PLink":"https://u.utrack.com.pk:3310","clientName":"Mr Jamshed","projectCategory":"Inventory Managment","startDate":"2025-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","endDate":"2025-12-15T00:00:00.000Z","address":"Utrack Tracking Company.","strategyTitle":"PERN Stack (PostgreSQL, Express.js, React, Node.js)","strategyDescription":"This project is built using the PERN Stack, a modern and powerful web development stack consisting of PostgreSQL, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js.","challengeTitle":"Role-Based Access Control","challengeDescription":"Implementing a secure and flexible role-based access system was one of the key challenges. The system needed to support multiple user roles with different permissions while ensuring both frontend and backend security and proper access control.","clientReview":{"clientImage":null,"reviewDescription":"","clientName":"Mr Jamshed","designation":"CEO Utrack","reviewStars":4.5},"relatedProjects":[],"createdAt":"2026-01-09T12:13:17.459Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-09T12:13:17.459Z","__v":0}}],"services":[{"id":"698d87dfcfa056d7560b2ec9","slug":"web-3-decentralized-internet-698d87dfcfa056d7560b2ec9","title":"Web 3 – Decentralized Internet","description":"Web 3 represents the future of the internet, offering decentralized networks, blockchain-based applications, and secure peer-to-peer interactions. This service empowers users with digital ownership, smart contracts, and transparent online ecosystems, reducing reliance on centralized platforms while enhancing privacy and control.","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1770883036/c3uvstrvi1hoijafewji.webp","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"698d87dfcfa056d7560b2ec9","Service":"Web 3 – Decentralized Internet","Description":"Web 3 represents the future of the internet, offering decentralized networks, blockchain-based applications, and secure peer-to-peer interactions. This service empowers users with digital ownership, smart contracts, and transparent online ecosystems, reducing reliance on centralized platforms w