project lifecycles — from database design and API development to frontend integration and deployment.\r\n\r\nMy focus is always on performance, scalability, and long-term maintainability rather than quick fixes. I can work independently, communicate clearly, and deliver within deadlines.\r\n\r\nI would be glad to discuss your project requirements and how I can contribute effectively.","Sequence":4,"createdAt":"2026-02-11T10:29:38.562Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-11T10:41:40.012Z","__v":0,"FbId":null,"GithubId":null,"LinkedinId":null,"PortfolioId":null},"role":"Senior Full Stack Developer","email":"sohailmcs87@gmail.com","phone":"+923216328470"},{"id":"69736eac220a6eb8356d5b5f","slug":"muhammad-sajid-nawaz-69736eac220a6eb8356d5b5f","title":"Muhammad Sajid Nawaz","description":"Muhammad Sajid Nawaz is a Sr. Network & DevOps Engineer with extensive experience in enterprise and ISP environments. He specializes in network & system architecture, MikroTik routing, multi-WAN connectivity, security, and system reliability, while leveraging Docker, Linux administration, CI/CD workflows, automation, and infrastructure monitoring to deliver scalable and highly available systems.system administration","image":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1769172651/fwzftnrsuc2zbsvwv5kq.jpg","category":"Network & data centre Designing deployment configuration","tags":[],"raw":{"_id":"69736eac220a6eb8356d5b5f","MemberImage":"http://res.cloudinary.com/df596zrjy/image/upload/v1769172651/fwzftnrsuc2zbsvwv5kq.jpg","MemberName":"Muhammad Sajid Nawaz","MemberDesignation":"Network & DevOps Engineer","MemberCoreSkill":"Network & data centre Designing deployment configuration","PhoneNumber":"+92 321 3017333","Email":"sajid.nawaz@gmail.com","Description":"Muhammad Sajid Nawaz is a Sr. Network & DevOps Engineer with extensive experience in enterprise and ISP environments. He specializes in network & system architecture, MikroTik routing, multi-WAN connectivity, security, and system reliabilit